@startuml
' Figure 5.2 – Class diagram, Sprint 3: interactions, notifications and metric rollups
!include ../_style.puml
skinparam nodesep 18
skinparam ranksep 45
hide circle
hide methods

class User {
  - id : UUID
  - username : String
}
class Article {
  - id : UUID
  - title : String
  - publishedAt : Timestamp
}
class Like
class Comment {
  - content : Text
  - deletedAt : Timestamp
}
class Repost
class Follow
class Notification {
  - type : NotificationType
  - data : Json
  - isRead : Boolean
}
class AnalyticsEvent {
  - eventType : AnalyticsEventType
  - metadata : Json
}
class ArticleMetrics {
  - totalViews : Integer
  - totalUniqueViews : Integer
  - avgReadTimeSec : Float
  - completionRate : Float
  - engagementRate : Float
  - paragraphDropoff : Json
}
class WriterAudienceMetrics {
  - totalUniqueReaders : Integer
  - returningReaderRate : Float
  - topCountries : Json
  - deviceSplit : Json
}
class WriterContentMetrics {
  - totalPublished : Integer
  - postingFrequency : Float
  - postingConsistency : Float
  - topTags : Json
}
class WriterQualityMetrics {
  - engagementRate : Float
  - repostRate : Float
  - commentDepth : Float
  - retentionCurve : Json
}

class NotificationType <<Enumeration>> {
  follow
  like
  comment
  reply
  repost
}
class AnalyticsEventType <<Enumeration>> {
  view
  scroll
  time_on_page
  like
  comment
  repost
}

User "1" -- "0..*" Like
User "1" -- "0..*" Comment
User "1" -- "0..*" Repost
User "1" -- "0..*" Follow
User "1" -- "0..*" Notification : receives
Article "1" -- "0..*" Like
Article "1" -- "0..*" Comment
Article "1" -- "0..*" Repost
Article "1" -- "0..*" AnalyticsEvent
Article "1" -- "0..1" ArticleMetrics : is rolled up into
User "1" -- "0..1" WriterAudienceMetrics
User "1" -- "0..1" WriterContentMetrics
User "1" -- "0..1" WriterQualityMetrics

note as N1
  paragraphDropoff, topCountries and deviceSplit are
  written NULL: no client-side capture source exists.
  NULL rather than zero, so "not measured" stays
  distinguishable from "measured, and none".
end note

ArticleMetrics -[hidden]down- WriterAudienceMetrics
WriterAudienceMetrics -[hidden]down- WriterContentMetrics
WriterContentMetrics -[hidden]down- WriterQualityMetrics
NotificationType -[hidden]down- AnalyticsEventType
@enduml
